<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>เข้าสู่ระบบ · LINE Workflow Admin</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans+Thai:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <style>body{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans Thai',system-ui,sans-serif}</style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#0C1628] flex items-center justify-center p-6">
  <div class="w-full max-w-sm">
    <div class="text-center mb-6">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#06C755] text-[#0C1628] font-bold text-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">L</div>
      <h1 class="text-white text-xl font-semibold">LINE Workflow Admin</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">ระบบจัดการบอทและสรุปแชทกลุ่ม</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl">
      <% if (flash) { %>
        <div class="mb-4 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm <%= flash.type === 'error' ? 'bg-red-50 text-red-700' : 'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700' %>">
          <%= flash.text %>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <form method="post" action="/login" class="space-y-4">
        <input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= next %>">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1 font-medium">ชื่อผู้ใช้</label>
          <input name="username" autocomplete="username" required autofocus
                 class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#06C755]">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1 font-medium">รหัสผ่าน</label>
          <input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required
                 class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#06C755]">
        </div>
        <button class="w-full bg-[#06C755] hover:bg-[#05a948] text-white rounded-lg py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold">
          เข้าสู่ระบบ
        </button>
      </form>

      <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-4 text-center">
        ค่าเริ่มต้นตั้งไว้ในไฟล์ .env (ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD)
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
